menuconfig MODULES_MC_INDI_POS_CONTROL
	bool "mc_indi_pos_control"
	default n
	depends on MODULES_MC_POS_CONTROL && MODULES_MC_ATT_CONTROL
	---help---
		Enable support for mc_indi_pos_control, an outer-loop (acceleration) INDI position controller
		that runs as an external flight mode and outputs vehicle_rates_setpoint.
		The stock position, attitude and rate controllers keep running for the other modes.
